WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:04.640
¿Encontraste algo interesante?

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:06.080
Damn!

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:07.360
Where's Veronica?

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:08.800
What did you do to her?

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:12.080
Hey.

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.480
Are you all right?

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.120
Did he hurt you?

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:16.560
I'm fine.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.080
Veronica!

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.200
Are you going to finally explain me

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:39.000
what just happened?

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:40.920
Uh...

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:43.480
I'm sorry, Anthony.

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:44.640
I...

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:45.800
I'm just too tired,

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:46.880
and I need to get some rest.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.480
Early morning tomorrow.

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:52.640
Hey, hey, are we going somewhere?

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.200
Business.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:55.840
And...

00:00:57.720 --> 00:00:59.000
I'm going with Mason.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.120
And you stay here.

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:03.120
What? No way.

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:04.080
Wasn't that the whole point

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:04.880
of hiring me?

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:06.000
Anthony.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:11.160
Remember, one thing.

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:14.160
I make the rules, and you follow.

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:17.680
Good night.
